# GameState.applyToGame ends with checkStateEffects(true) (GameState.java:687),
# so the steal in setup.state is applied before any untap step: the Bears are
# already the human's when the human's turn begins. Their CR 502.3 untap and
# the end of their summoning sickness (CR 302.6, a creature the controller has
# controlled continuously since the turn began) both follow. Applying the
# steal at the first pass after the untap step instead leaves the Bears tapped
# and sick on the thief's own turn.
startturn human
